window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-165-4f263c561e16a5a9.json"]={sha256:"4f263c561e16a5a9b33a0063acf60bbf1913f378d9a993c2c840ba7973c8bdc1",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-ace248d0af6d547d","url":"https://www.ieee802.org/3/ah/","title":"IEEE 802.3ah Ethernet in the First Mile task force","titleEn":"IEEE 802.3ah Ethernet in the First Mile task force","publisher":"IEEE 802.3","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-165","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-165","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-166","referenceUrls":["https://www.ieee802.org/3/av/"],"title":"10G-EPON：突發保護時間的效率成本","titleEn":"10G-EPON: burst guard-time efficiency cost","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 本題等權教學門檻J≥0.9；第一組通過、第二組未通過；加權服務需另定公平基準。 mpcp_grants.csv與尺度不變對照 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 1 與變更 0.75 Jain index、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. For this equal-weight exercise requireJ≥0.9: first passes and second fails; weighted service needs a different reference. mpcp_grants.csv and scale-invariance control Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 1 and changed 0.75 Jain index, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學時間效率至少0.95；32組通過、64組不足；禁止為追效率直接刪除必要保護時間。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching efficiency minimum0.95:32 passes and64 fails; required guard time must not simply be removed to improve a ratio.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成4ONU額度[1,1,1,1]與[1,1,1,3]，單位都是kB/round，四者需求都足夠。 名義式 (1+1+1+1)**2/(4*(1+1+1+1)) = 1 Jain index；變更式 (1+1+1+3)**2/(4*(1+1+1+9)) = 0.75 Jain index。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 直接列每ONU平方與總和；將全部額度乘10後指標應不變，驗證量綱不變性。","合成1 ms輪、32突發，各1 µs保護；變更64突發，輪長不變。 名義式 (1000-32*1)/1000 = 0.968 time efficiency；變更式 (1000-64*1)/1000 = 0.936 time efficiency。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 在時間軸排列突發與保護區，總長應等於1 ms；驗證最後一段未越輪界。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic four-ONU grants[1,1,1,1] and[1,1,1,3] kB/round, all with sufficient demand. Nominal (1+1+1+1)**2/(4*(1+1+1+1)) = 1 Jain index; changed (1+1+1+3)**2/(4*(1+1+1+9)) = 0.75 Jain index. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Tabulate individual squares and totals; multiply all grants by10 and verify scale invariance.","Synthetic1 ms cycle with32 bursts and1 µs guard each; change to64 bursts at fixed cycle duration. Nominal (1000-32*1)/1000 = 0.968 time efficiency; changed (1000-64*1)/1000 = 0.936 time efficiency. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Lay out bursts and guards on a timeline summing to1 ms and check the last interval against the cycle boundary.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-175","referenceUrls":["https://www.2africacable.net/faq"],"title":"2Africa：多登陸點與共同失效風險","titleEn":"2Africa: multiple landings and common-cause risk","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 本題等權教學門檻J≥0.9；第一組通過、第二組未通過；加權服務需另定公平基準。 mpcp_grants.csv與尺度不變對照 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 1 與變更 0.75 Jain index、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. For this equal-weight exercise requireJ≥0.9: first passes and second fails; weighted service needs a different reference. mpcp_grants.csv and scale-invariance control Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 1 and changed 0.75 Jain index, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學共同不可用上限0.001；原設計失敗、分離設施後的假設模型通過；實際機率需維運證據。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching joint unavailability limit0.001:original fails and the separated-facility assumption passes; operational evidence is needed for actual probabilities.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成4ONU額度[1,1,1,1]與[1,1,1,3]，單位都是kB/round，四者需求都足夠。 名義式 (1+1+1+1)**2/(4*(1+1+1+1)) = 1 Jain index；變更式 (1+1+1+3)**2/(4*(1+1+1+9)) = 0.75 Jain index。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 直接列每ONU平方與總和；將全部額度乘10後指標應不變，驗證量綱不變性。","以2Africa多登陸系統為背景；合成兩路各不可用機率0.01，共同設施機率0.005；改善後共同機率0.0001。 名義式 0.005+(1-0.005)*0.01*0.01 = 0.0050995 probability；變更式 0.0001+(1-0.0001)*0.01*0.01 = 0.00019999 probability。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 列共同失效/未失效互斥樹，各葉機率總和需為1；用條件蒙地卡羅抽樣核對量級，不把小樣本零故障當零風險。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic four-ONU grants[1,1,1,1] and[1,1,1,3] kB/round, all with sufficient demand. Nominal (1+1+1+1)**2/(4*(1+1+1+1)) = 1 Jain index; changed (1+1+1+3)**2/(4*(1+1+1+9)) = 0.75 Jain index. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Tabulate individual squares and totals; multiply all grants by10 and verify scale invariance.","2Africa motivates a multi-landing exercise:two synthetic paths each unavailable with probability0.01, common facility0.005, improved to0.0001. Nominal 0.005+(1-0.005)*0.01*0.01 = 0.0050995 probability; changed 0.0001+(1-0.0001)*0.01*0.01 = 0.00019999 probability. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Enumerate mutually exclusive common-failure branches summing to one; conditionally simulate to check scale without treating zero observed failures as zero risk.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-109996de5da25845","url":"https://www.ieee802.org/3/av/","title":"IEEE 802.3av 10G-EPON task force","titleEn":"IEEE 802.3av 10G-EPON task force","publisher":"IEEE 802.3","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-116e50572626a3ed","url":"https://www.2africacable.net/faq","title":"2Africa cable system: project and landing overview","titleEn":"2Africa cable system: project and landing overview","publisher":"2Africa consortium","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
